den's detail plate: the selected Work Item's Next Step, Waiting On and
Explanation, as pre-wrapped lines (Rust wraps them to the plate's width).

Line styles: label (structure), strong (title), step (teal), caution (amber,
always with a "!" or "⚠" glyph in the text), muted, plain.

--- Detail
div w-full h-full flex-col bg-[#aa0002] px-2 pt-1
  div h-[1] text-[#aa000a] "{detail_label}"
  div h-[1]
  for item in lines
    if {is_label}
      div h-[1] text-[#aa000a] "{text}"
    else if {is_strong}
      div h-[1] font-bold text-[#aa0006] "{text}"
    else if {is_step}
      div h-[1] font-bold text-[#aa0009] "{text}"
    else if {is_caution}
      div h-[1] text-[#aa000f] "{text}"
    else if {is_muted}
      div h-[1] text-[#aa0007] "{text}"
    else
      div h-[1] text-[#aa0005] "{text}"
  div flex-1
